sequenceDiagram
  participant Src as SIEM Manual UI
  participant API as FastAPI EventIngress
  participant Container as bootstrap/container
  participant Route as RouteAndEnqueueEvent
  participant Orch as EnqueueWorkerJobs
  participant Queue as Kafka worker.jobs
  participant Worker as WorkerOrchestrator
  participant Job as RunWorkerJob
  participant Pipeline as worker pipeline
  participant Kernel as AgentRunKernel
  participant RT as AgentRuntime
  participant Bus as SecureAgentBus
  participant Critic as CriticService

  Src->>API: POST /events or /v1/engagements
  API->>Container: get_route_and_enqueue / get_start_engagement
  Container->>Route: CorrelationIdPort injected
  alt engagement.start meta_llm
    Route->>Route: MetaPlanner EngagementPlan
  else engagement.start declarative
    Route->>Route: plan_loader + EventRouter rules
  end
  Route->>Orch: enqueue_from_routing
  Orch->>Queue: WorkerJob persona in payload
  Worker->>Queue: dequeue consumer group egregore-workers
  Note over Worker,Queue: foreign persona re-enqueued to worker.jobs
  Worker->>Job: run_job execution only
  Job->>Pipeline: context agent validate publish finalize
  Pipeline->>Kernel: execute RunKernelRequest
  Kernel->>RT: arun tools memory middleware
  RT-->>Kernel: structured finding
  Kernel-->>Job: RunKernelResult
  Job->>Bus: send_message findings
  Bus->>Critic: L2 validate trust_score HITL
